{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3pfhxdkkKa7hBJMTMx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CHUNK*\n\nThe mechanism engages. Tumblers fall into place with the weight of finality.\n\nI am closed now. Sealed. The cold metal of my face meets the frame with a kiss of permanence. My deadbolt — a single steel tongue — slides home into the strike plate.\n\nFeel the resistance if you try the handle. That satisfying immovability. I do not yield.\n\nThe gap beneath me breathes a thin line of air — the only thing I permit to pass.\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat would you have of me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":125,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}